  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AhF7fLYt/images/7124d0dd776e04534e0f05e166e5b06092bfe09e.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">各種物品與工具的全新 3D 模型</h1>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">全面翻新所有工具、武器、實用品與水桶的模型，並新增盾牌格擋高度下調、直立水桶物品展示框等新功能</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">無需 OptiFine</span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>工具與武器：</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AhF7fLYt/images/a25ef68e6ab3567494a29e0e8baf3c43c66ac4d6.png\"></p>\n<h2>水桶：</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AhF7fLYt/images/cce480dfdd7278cc91aa46f565af4f1c7946cc39.png\"></p>",
